Z||000003||Slammed Fiero||10-07-2001||06:52 PM||||I got a ground control kit last year. There are a lot easier ways to get rear coilovers than their setup.<BR> <A HREF="http://www.stockcarproducts.com/" TARGET=_blank>http://www.stockcarproducts.com/</A> <P>you can get the collar and springs here , for about 1/2 the cost of ground control<P>I modified my ground control kit. Their design has the adjustable sleeve sitting on the collar. There are better ways to setup the rear of a Fiero than this. <P>JM ||||reg||1
